# Functional Test Cases — Pharmacy Benefit Checker (Sprint 14)

---

## ✅ Step 1 + 2 — Test Case Table

---

### TC-FUNC-AC1-01 | Authentication Gate

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC1-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC1 — Member must be authenticated before accessing the feature. Guest access not permitted |
| **Scenario** | Unauthenticated user attempts to access the Pharmacy Benefit Checker directly via URL |
| **Pre-conditions** | User is NOT logged in. Pharmacy Benefit Checker URL is known |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Open a browser in incognito/guest mode. 2. Navigate directly to the Pharmacy Benefit Checker URL on the member portal. 3. Observe system behavior |
| **Expected Result** | System redirects user to the login page. The Pharmacy Benefit Checker feature is not accessible without authentication |
| **Pass Criteria** | User is redirected to login. No benefit data is displayed to unauthenticated user |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

