### TC-FUNC-AC2-01 | Drug Name Search (Desktop)

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC2-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC2 — Member can search for a drug by name on desktop |
| **Scenario** | Logged-in member searches for a drug by entering its name on the desktop portal |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in. Desktop browser is being used. Drug name is a valid formulary entry |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a valid member. 2. Navigate to the Pharmacy Benefit Checker page. 3. Enter a known drug name (e.g., "Metformin") in the search field. 4. Submit the search. 5. Observe the results |
| **Expected Result** | Search results are returned and display coverage status, formulary tier, and copay indicator for the searched drug |
| **Pass Criteria** | Results load successfully. All three data fields (coverage status, tier, copay) are visible on desktop |
| **Severity** | 🟡 Medium |

