### TC-FUNC-AC3-01 | Search Results Display — All Required Fields

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC3-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC3 — Results must show coverage status, formulary tier (1–4), and copay estimate with ACA disclaimer |
| **Scenario** | Logged-in member searches for a covered drug and verifies all required result fields are displayed |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in on desktop. Searched drug exists in the formulary and is covered |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a valid member on a standard (non-batch-cache) plan. 2. Navigate to Pharmacy Benefit Checker. 3. Search for a drug confirmed as "Covered" in the formulary. 4. Review the results page. 5. Verify presence of: (a) Coverage status label, (b) Tier number (1–4), (c) Copay estimate, (d) ACA disclaimer text |
| **Expected Result** | All four elements are present on the results screen: Coverage = "Covered", Tier value between 1–4, copay indicator, and ACA disclaimer |
| **Pass Criteria** | No field is missing or blank. Tier value is within the range 1–4. Disclaimer is visible without scrolling on desktop |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

