### TC-FUNC-AC4-01 | ACA Disclaimer — Compliance Validation

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC4-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC4 — All cost estimates must display the ACA-required disclaimer about cost variability |
| **Scenario** | Verify ACA disclaimer appears on every search result that includes a cost/copay estimate |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in. At least one drug search returns a copay estimate |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a valid member. 2. Navigate to Pharmacy Benefit Checker. 3. Search for 3 different drugs across different tiers. 4. On each results screen, check for the disclaimer text indicating actual costs may vary based on deductible and network status. 5. Document presence/absence for each search |
| **Expected Result** | ACA disclaimer appears on every results screen where a copay estimate is displayed — without exception |
| **Pass Criteria** | Disclaimer is present on 100% of results screens with cost data. Missing disclaimer on even one result = test FAIL |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

