### TC-FUNC-AC5-01 | Last-Updated Timestamp — Batch Cache Plans

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC5-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC5 — HMO Classic, PPO Select, CHIP members must see a last-updated timestamp on results |
| **Scenario** | Member on a batch-cache plan searches for a drug and verifies the last-updated timestamp is displayed |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in with an HMO Classic, PPO Select, or CHIP plan. Nightly batch cache has been populated |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a member on HMO Classic plan. 2. Navigate to Pharmacy Benefit Checker. 3. Search for a known drug. 4. Observe the results page. 5. Verify a last-updated timestamp is displayed. 6. Confirm the timestamp reflects the most recent nightly batch run (within 24 hours). 7. Repeat steps 1–6 for PPO Select and CHIP plan members |
| **Expected Result** | A last-updated timestamp is visible on results for all three batch-cache plan types. Timestamp is accurate to the last nightly batch |
| **Pass Criteria** | Timestamp present and visible for HMO Classic, PPO Select, and CHIP. Timestamp absent for real-time plan members |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

