### TC-FUNC-AC6-01 | Real-Time Data — Non-Batch Plans

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC6-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC6 — All non-batch-cache plan types must return real-time formulary data |
| **Scenario** | Member on a standard (non-batch) plan receives real-time formulary results |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in on a plan that is NOT HMO Classic, PPO Select, or CHIP. Formulary API is operational |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a member on a standard real-time plan. 2. Navigate to Pharmacy Benefit Checker. 3. Search for a drug. 4. Note the result and timestamp (if any). 5. Have a test data admin update the drug's formulary status in the system. 6. Search for the same drug again immediately. 7. Verify the updated status is reflected |
| **Expected Result** | The second search reflects the updated formulary status in real time — no 24-hour lag |
| **Pass Criteria** | Updated status appears immediately after the formulary change. No stale data for non-batch plan members |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

