### TC-FUNC-AC7-01 | Drug Not Found — Compliant Messaging

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC7-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC7 — Drug not in formulary must show "Requires Review" — NOT auto "Not Covered" |
| **Scenario** | Member searches for a drug that does not exist in the formulary and verifies the correct message is displayed |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in. A drug name is confirmed to NOT be in the formulary database |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a valid member. 2. Navigate to Pharmacy Benefit Checker. 3. Search for a drug name confirmed as absent from the formulary. 4. Observe the message displayed on the results screen |
| **Expected Result** | System displays a message indicating the drug requires further review. System does NOT display "Not Covered" |
| **Pass Criteria** | Result message does not contain "Not Covered" language. Message explicitly indicates further review is needed |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

