### TC-FUNC-AC8-01 | All Plan Types Supported

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC8-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC8 — Feature must support all plan types on the Carelon member portal |
| **Scenario** | Members across multiple plan types can successfully search for a drug and receive results |
| **Pre-conditions** | Test accounts exist for each plan type available on the Carelon portal. Drug name is valid across all plans |
