### TC-FUNC-AC9-01 | Mobile Out of Scope Enforcement

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-FUNC-AC9-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC9 — Mobile experience is out of scope for Sprint 14. Feature is desktop-only |
| **Scenario** | Verify the feature is functional and complete on desktop. Mobile optimization is not tested |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in on a desktop browser (Chrome/Edge/Firefox latest versions) |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a valid member on a desktop browser. 2. Navigate to Pharmacy Benefit Checker. 3. Complete a drug search. 4. Verify all AC elements are displayed correctly on desktop viewport. 5. Note: Do NOT test on mobile device for Sprint 14 — mobile is out of scope |
| **Expected Result** | Full feature functions correctly on desktop. No mobile test execution required in Sprint 14 |
| **Pass Criteria** | Desktop experience is complete and all ACs pass. Mobile regression noted as deferred |
| **Severity** | 🟡 Medium |

> ⚠️ **Flag:** AC9 as written is a scope exclusion, not a testable criterion. There is no positive behavior to verify beyond desktop completeness. Recommend adding a separate AC for minimum mobile compatibility baseline (e.g., "feature must not break existing mobile portal pages") — currently this is a **Gap** requiring stakeholder clarification.

